        "cooked": "<p>So, according to Beacon's write up in Tactics, she and her father were too injured by fighting Iron Legacy to go to Mars and fall for Baron Blade's trap - other heroes went instead and stopped him.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Since Vengance is the release after Shattered Timelines, does that mean that the Vengeful Five is the scheme that should have successfully killed Legacy?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(Sorry if this has already been discussed)</p>",
