        "created_at": "2014-09-02T15:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Iron Legacy certainly happens <em>before</em>&nbsp;the V5 teamup.&nbsp;</p><p>Iron Legacy has quotes from the issue Freedom Five Annual #25</p><p>There are multiple quotes found from the V5 members from Freedom Five Annual #27</p><p>The Annuals are reserved as the major cross over events for our heros. We can construct rough timelines around them.</p>",
